*.dSYM/

# Local firmware and UI artifacts. Keep only the curated public preview.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/dashboard-preview-v2-round.png

# The companion is built and wrapped locally so Bluetooth permission, device
# binding, executable paths, and logs never become repository data.
companion/.local/
companion/dist/
companion/launchd/*.plist
!companion/launchd/*.plist.example

# Deferred microphone/audio research is intentionally outside the public MVP.
diagnostics/
mac-audio-bridge/
usb-mic-prototype/
include/BleMicStreamer.h
src/BleMicStreamer.cpp
docs/BLE_AUDIO_HOST_VALIDATION.md
docs/MAC_AUDIO_BRIDGE.md
docs/MAC_AUDIO_DOWNLINK.md
docs/MIC_CAPTURE_NOTES.md
docs/USB_MIC_PLAN.md

